#: lib/speedreader.c:606
msgid ""
"This is an easy speed reading utility to help train you to read faster. It "
"does this by flashing words at a rapid rate on the screen."
msgstr "Irakurketa azkarrerako tresna erraz bat da, azkarrago irakurtzen trebatzen laguntzeko. Horretarako, hitzak abiadura handian erakusten ditu pantailan."

